@page "/help"
@page "/tutorial"
<PageTitle>Support</PageTitle>
<section class="support">
    <img class="support-mark" src="images/gpstrainer-icon.svg" alt="GPS Trainer" width="72" height="72" />
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <h2>Training videos</h2>
    <ul class="support-lessons">
        <li>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q1QgitCJEDs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lesson 1</a>
            <span>Define your first course</span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mam7qHclL2Y" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lesson 2</a>
            <span>More advanced features</span>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Documentation</h2>
    <p>gpsTrainer speaks your pace, speed, distance, and the turns on a course while you move. Intervals are a start marker and a finish marker. After a race, this site times how long the track took to cross each pair.</p>
    <h2>Account</h2>
    <p>The phone and this site share one login.</p>
    <h2>Synchronization</h2>
    <p>A course shows up on the phone after it is enabled for download.</p>
    <p class="support-more"><a href="testimonials">Testimonials</a> · <a href="privacy">Privacy policy</a></p>
</section>
